    <textTemplates>
        <name>CaseCreationCLFCaseTemplate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Subject: Re: Ringcentral Case #{!$Record.CaseNumber} Closing the Loop/Contacting you regarding your recent Relationship Feedback Response taken on {!$Record.Case_Created_Date__c}

Hello {!$Record.ContactName__c} ,
My name is {!$Record.Owner:User.Full_Name__c}, and I am a Customer Experience Manager at RingCentral. Thank you for taking the time to give us your feedback today.

In my role, we focus on working with customers who have taken the time to provide us with feedback. My goal is to promptly find answers and help resolve any issues or questions you may have. 

I would be happy to discuss your feedback further to ensure we are doing what we can to meet your needs. You can reply to this email to reach me.

I look forward to hearing back from you.

Thank you!

{!$Record.Owner:User.Full_Name__c}

Customer Experience Manager</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>EmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hello {!$Record.Owner:User.Full_Name__c},

It has been 15 business days since a follow-up case was created for one of your customers who has had a poor experience, and that case remains open through today.

Here is the link to the case: {!BaseUrl}{!$Record.Id}

We want to make sure it wasn&apos;t missed and also check-in with you if you might need help closing-the-loop.
Your manager and our team (vocadminteam@ringcentral.com) are here to help you.

Thank you!
Sincerely,
RingCentral Voice of the Customer Team</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>TAM_NoConsentEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Hello {!TAM_Email_Recipient_Name},&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of your customers responded to a Medallia survey with a detractor rating and did not wish to be contacted. &lt;strong&gt;Closed Loop Feedback Case #{!$Record.CaseNumber} has been created. This case may not have been assigned to you just yet.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here is the link to the case: &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!BaseUrl}{!$Record.Id}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What should you do next?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) Review the full response by clicking this link: {!$Record.Log_File_URL__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2) Once assigned, if this is an unknown contact and feedback is unclear and/or does not align with feedback from main contacts, please reach out to your main contact(s) to garner additional insight as appropriate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3) Document closing-the-loop outcomes and reasons for detraction using the provided write-up template.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;RingCentral Voice of the Customer Team&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>TAM_UC_WithConsentEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Hello {!TAM_Email_Recipient_Name},&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of your customers responded to a Medallia survey with a detractor rating. &lt;strong&gt;Closed Loop Feedback Case #{!$Record.CaseNumber}  has been created. This case may not have been assigned to you just yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here is the link to the case: &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;{!BaseUrl}{!$Record.Id}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What should you do next?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) Review the full response by clicking this link: &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Log_File_URL__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2) Once assigned, follow up with the customer regarding their feedback ASAP, but respecting their business hours. Use a combination of calls and emails to improve your outreach success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3) Document closing-the-loop outcomes and reasons for detraction using the provided write-up template.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;RingCentral Voice of the Customer Team&lt;/p&gt;</text>
